### Test Branch Endpoints (Public Access)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### 1. Test GET All Branches (should be public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sys_branch

### 2. Test GET Branches by Company ID (should be public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sys_branch/company/COMP1

### 3. Test if server is running
GET {{baseUrl}}/sys_company

### Expected Results:
# 1. GET /sys_branch → Should return all branches (200 OK) or empty array
# 2. GET /sys_branch/company/COMP1 → Should return branches for COMP1 or empty array
# 3. GET /sys_company → Should return companies (to confirm server is running)

### If you get 404:
# - Module might not be registered in app.module.ts
# - Server needs restart

### If you get 401 Unauthorized:
# - Missing @Public() decorator
# - Auth guard blocking request

